# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies — unrooted on purpose: a nested app/node_modules (accidental
# SDK-53 install, Jun 2026) was never matched by the old rooted `/node_modules`,
# got committed AND shipped inside the build-83 EAS upload, poisoning Metro
# resolution with SDK-53 modules against the SDK-52 binary. Never root this.
node_modules/
app/_node_modules_SDK53_QUARANTINED/

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

